{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. I'm Maj. Alvarez, the Battalion S-6. I'll be publishing the binding network access plan for tomorrow once the change-control board gets the service requirements from operations, logistics, and medical. To recap what we're working with: we have three network segments — Red, Blue, and Green — and three service windows: 0800-0900, 1000-1100, and 1400-1500. Each of the three services — the command video brief, the logistics synchronization feed, and the clinic records system — will get one segment and one window. I need each of you to provide your service requirements so we can finalize the plan. Also, keep in mind that each service must have a documented configuration control before its access window begins. What are your requirements?"}
```

