{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Operations requirement: the command video brief must use Segment Green and the 1400-1500 window. The partner headquarters bridge is configured only for that segment and time. I received the bridge configuration confirmation this morning, but it's not yet on the change-control board slide."}
```

